      "description": "Class 4a: bare 'x' ENTER \u2014 x is unbound in the interactive eval context. Expect STATE_ERROR with body 'Undefined var' (eval.c:103 CE_ERR_UNDEFINED, passed through src/main.c:2327 fallback).",
